3. What's Already Good
Good area	Evidence and value
Parameterized data access	The 44 stored-procedure calls pass their values through 95 CrearParametro calls to procedures named by constants (EnumComunes.cs:217-300 (../../General/HotScan/Aplicacion/Enums/EnumComunes.cs#L217-L300)); there is no SQL text, SqlCommand or SqlConnection in the C#, and all 41 distinct procedure names exist in the database project
Database write procedures	All 23 write-capable scripts use TRY/CATCH, THROW, an explicit transaction and XACT_ABORT ON, and 22 of them write an Auditoria.ErrorLog row (for example IT24/001 SP usp_ActualizaCancelaOperacionCliente_HotScan.sql:51-54 (../../StoredProcedures/MWD_DB/DBMDW/General/HotScan/IT24/Procedures/001%20SP%20usp_ActualizaCancelaOperacionCliente_HotScan.sql#L51-L54), IT24/001 SP usp_ActualizaCancelaOperacionCliente_HotScan.sql:116-147 (../../StoredProcedures/MWD_DB/DBMDW/General/HotScan/IT24/Procedures/001%20SP%20usp_ActualizaCancelaOperacionCliente_HotScan.sql#L116-L147) and IT24/037 SP usp_InsertCtrlDevolucionesHit_HotScan.sql:42-92 (../../StoredProcedures/MWD_DB/DBMDW/General/HotScan/IT24/Procedures/037%20SP%20usp_InsertCtrlDevolucionesHit_HotScan.sql#L42-L92)); five of the six dynamic-SQL procedures quote the table with QUOTENAME and run through sp_executesql with typed parameters (the sixth is HS-FR-39), and two of them whitelist the filter column (IT24/007 SP usp_ActualizaNuevoEstatus_HotScan.sql:56-76 (../../StoredProcedures/MWD_DB/DBMDW/General/HotScan/IT24/Procedures/007%20SP%20usp_ActualizaNuevoEstatus_HotScan.sql#L56-L76))
Return idempotency in the database	The signature procedure detects a repeated tracking key instead of inserting a second return (Enlace/002 SP MUFG_MX2_InsertaFirmaDigitalDevolucionInterfaceTOMI_HotScan.sql:112-131 (../../StoredProcedures/MWD_DB/DBMDW/General/HotScan/Enlace/Procedures/002%20SP%20MUFG_MX2_InsertaFirmaDigitalDevolucionInterfaceTOMI_HotScan.sql#L112-L131)); only the way it reports the duplicate is a defect (HS-FR-40)
Loopback-only listener and bounded input	The shared TCP base binds to IPAddress.Loopback, limits a frame to 1 MB and the number of concurrent clients with a semaphore (WindowsTcpServiceHostBase.cs:20-37 (../../General/MUFGT24_BTMUM_64/MUFG_T24/Core/Estructura/WindowsTcpServiceHostBase.cs#L20-L37)), so the listener is not expected to be reachable from other machines, and the memory taken by one frame is capped
